# `builtin:kubernetes`

Runs a local Kubernetes cluster. The `driver` field names the tool that creates it. See [Kubernetes clusters]({{< relref "/docs/guides/kubernetes" >}}).

```cue
cluster: {
    uses: "builtin:kubernetes"
    with: {
        driver: "kind"
        workers: worker_a: {}
        egress: ["docker.io", "*.docker.io", "*.docker.com"]
    }
}
```

[[template "table" .Definitions.Config]]

## Drivers

| Driver | Command on the host |
|:-------|:--------------------|
| `kind` | [`kind`](https://kind.sigs.k8s.io/) |

